            "detailed_description": "Tired of the kids that love ice cream and hate vegetables, the evil broccoli gathers an army.<br />\r\nHis plan is to destroy the flavor universe.<br />\r\nand to force everyone to eat tasteless vegetables.Are you ready to free the universe from the Evil Vegetables?",
            "about_the_game": "Tired of the kids that love ice cream and hate vegetables, the evil broccoli gathers an army.<br />\r\nHis plan is to destroy the flavor universe.<br />\r\nand to force everyone to eat tasteless vegetables.Are you ready to free the universe from the Evil Vegetables?",
            "short_description": "The evil Broccoli, irritated by the fact that kids hate vegetables and love ice creams, has created an army of vegetables to destroy the flavor galaxy. Only the Ice Cream Surfer with the help of his 4 super tasty friends can prevent that.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong>, Francês<strong>*</strong>, Italiano<strong>*</strong>, Alemão<strong>*</strong>, Espanhol (Espanha)<strong>*</strong>, Dinamarquês<strong>*</strong>, Holandês<strong>*</strong>, Português (Portugal)<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
